      "date": "2026-02-07T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Suraj Industries Ltd (BSE:526211) entered into agreement to acquire 50.03% stake in VRV Foods Ltd for approximately INR 370 million.",
      "body": "Suraj Industries Ltd (BSE:526211) entered into agreement to acquire 50.03% stake in VRV Foods Ltd for approximately INR 370 million on February 7, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 371.28 million valued at INR 66 per share will be paid by Suraj Industries Ltd. As part of consideration, INR 371.28 million is paid towards common equity of VRV Foods Ltd.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, VRV Foods Ltd reported total revenue of INR 1.23 billion and net income of INR 31.6 million.\n\nThe transaction is subject to approval of offer by acquirer shareholders and approval of offer by acquirer board. The deal has been approved by the board. The expected completion of the transaction is financial years 2025–26 and 2026–27.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "80",
